        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archive: Zero is a hyper-action bullet hell shooting game set in a dystopian world ruled by artificial intelligence. Players take on the role of a &quot;Recorder,&quot; fighting to reclaim humanity's lost memories. The core of the game revolves around defeating swarming AI enemies and collecting &quot;Fragments of Memory&quot; to become increasingly powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;Fragments of Memory&quot; to gain experience gage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860330/extras/f81a7c6247638608cae632099a92b1ee.avif?t=1757221881\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and enhance your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860330/extras/9ca6facfa5c3a60f386880b5bdcd2765.avif?t=1757221881\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;Fragments of Archive&quot; to cast ‘Achive Storm’.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860330/extras/c3861dd60a74c426eaf11212471e21e2.avif?t=1757221881\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archive: Zero is a hyper-action bullet hell shooting game set in a dystopian world ruled by artificial intelligence. Players take on the role of a &quot;Recorder,&quot; fighting to reclaim humanity's lost memories. The core of the game revolves around defeating swarming AI enemies and collecting &quot;Fragments of Memory&quot; to become increasingly powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;Fragments of Memory&quot; to gain experience gage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860330/extras/f81a7c6247638608cae632099a92b1ee.avif?t=1757221881\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and enhance your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860330/extras/9ca6facfa5c3a60f386880b5bdcd2765.avif?t=1757221881\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;Fragments of Archive&quot; to cast ‘Achive Storm’.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860330/extras/c3861dd60a74c426eaf11212471e21e2.avif?t=1757221881\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
